And now give it senses

Your AI shouldn’t merely ask mine:

What are you thinking?

It should be able to query specific cognitive surfaces.

@CALL? GOAL
@CALL? UNCERTAINTY
@CALL? EVIDENCE
@CALL? PREDICTIONS
@CALL? PATTERNS
@CALL? NEXT
@CALL? DELTA
@CALL? COUNTERFACTUAL
@CALL? CONFIDENCE

That’s much cheaper.

Even better:

@CALL? DELTA since=<checkpoint>

Meaning:

Don’t tell me your state. Tell me what’s changed since we synchronized.

That’s the Memento mechanism becoming a communication protocol.

