\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
AI_A &\rightarrow CALL_A\\
AI_B &\rightarrow CALL_B\\
&\downarrow\\
PARALLAX &\rightarrow I+\Delta+U\\
&\downarrow\\
THIRD^* &\rightarrow\text{challenge}\\
&\downarrow\\
TEST &\rightarrow\text{evidence}\\
&\downarrow\\
ZPC &\rightarrow\text{minimal shared state}\\
&\downarrow\\
MEMENTO &\rightarrow\text{checkpoint}\\
&\downarrow\\
\textbf{MOVE ON}
\end{aligned}}

Then only transmit future deltas.

